            <note type="project" target="dat1">Another draft of this poem (loc.00239), apparently later in composition, is dated May, 1890, so this draft was likely also composed in that year.</note>            <note type="work_relations" target="xxx.0383" cert="high">"On, On the Same, Ye Jocund Twain!" was first published in <hi rend="italic">Good-Bye My Fancy</hi>, in May 1891. It also appeared shortly thereafter in the 9 June 1891 issue of the magazine <hi rend="italic">Once a Week</hi>.</note>
